```{=html}
<div class="np-grid">
  <% for (const item of items) { %>
    <div class="np-tile">
      <h3><%= item.title %></h3>
      <p><%= item.description %><% if (item.footer) { %><%= item.description.trim().endsWith('.') ? '' : '.' %> <%= item.footer %>.<% } %></p>
      <a class="tk-btn tk-btn-primary" href="<%= item.link %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe →</a>
    </div>
  <% } %>
</div>
```
